<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">summer of soul</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;When we grow up, we often leave our fond childhood memories behind to focus on the future. Not that there is anything wrong with that! The future is uncertain and holds a vast amount of possibilities for us. But, sometimes to unwind, it's better for us to look back at the good old times. After 4 long years of highschool, Adora is ready to go to college but wants to have one last enjoyable summer vacation before her next summers would be filled with studying and taking extra classes for the next semesters. So, she takes a trip down memory lane and comes back to a camp that she and her old friend, Catra, used to go together when they were younger, as a counselor. Adora meets new counselors and befriends them and even gets to take care of cute kids, but her mind always wonders to her old friend. Before she knows it, she's standing in front of Catra, who coincidentally is also a counselor for Camp Etheria. Unlike Adora who is eager to reconnect with her, Catra holds a grudge and makes it clear that she wants nothing to do with Adora. Summer is only a couple of months, would that be enough time for these two old friends to stitch up their torn friendship?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>applesauce6</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma/Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista/Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
